ter-v*n.psf.gz, ter-v*b.psf.gz: Terminus Font, regular and bold, 14 to 32
pixels high (8x14, 8x16, 10x18, 10x20, 11x22, 12x24, 14x28, 16x32; from
Alpine's font-terminus). Photon, Lepton's Wayland compositor, and its
terminal draw text with them: 8x16 everywhere, the others for a terminal
window's text size (Ctrl+=, Ctrl+-, Ctrl+0).

Terminus Font is Copyright (C) 2020 Dimitar Toshkov Zhekov, licensed under
the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1 (https://openfontlicense.org).
